"econtent": "", "exerId": 2715265, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "单选", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 1, "optNum": 4, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 1, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "C", "rightRate": 0, "score": 4, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 4, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "把Zn粒加入0.1mol/L盐酸中，若要加快产生H<sub>2</sub>的速率，可采取的方法是【】", "topicType": "单选题", "ueId": 2715265, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 10}, {"a": "SO<sub>2</sub>", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【考情点拨】本题考查了氧化剂与还原剂的知识点。<br>【应试指导】化学反应中失去电子或所含元素化合价升高的物质，为“还原剂”。反之，得到电子或所含元素化合价降低的物质，为“氧化剂”。A项SO<sub>2</sub>中硫元素的化合价为十4价，其化合价在化学反应中既可以升高（为十6价)，也可以降低（为0价或一2价）；B项Fe<sup>2+</sup>中也存在同样的情况，即SO<sub>2</sub>和Fe<sup>2+</sup>在氧化还原反应中，既可作氧化剂又可作还原剂；而D项Na<sup>+</sup>为十1价，在氧化还原反应中只能获得电子被还原，作氧化剂；C项<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S49.png' />的化合价为一2价，在氧化还原反应中，其化合价只能升高，作还原剂。", "b": "Fe<sup>2+</sup>", "c": "S<sup>2-</sup>", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "Na<sup>+</sup>", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715266, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "单选", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 1, "optNum": 4, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 1, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "C", "rightRate": 0, "score": 4, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 4, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "下列物质在氧化还原反应中只能作还原剂的是【】", "topicType": "单选题", "ueId": 2715266, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 11}, {"a": "H<sub>2</sub> SO<sub>4</sub>", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【考情点拨】本题考查了离子键与共价键的知识点。<br>【应试指导】离子键：阴阳离子间通过静电作用所形成的化学键；共价键：原子间通过共用电子对所形成的化学键。本题所给选项H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>和CH<sub>4</sub>都是只含非金属元素，故只存在共价键。KCl中只存在离子键。NaOH中氧原子和氢原子是通过共用电子对（共价键）形成氢氧根，而Na<sup>+</sup>与OH<sup>-</sup>又通过离子键结合成离子化合物NaOH,NaOH中既有离子键又有共价键。", "b": "KCI", "c": "NaOH", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "CH<sub>4</sub>", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715267, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "单选", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 1, "optNum": 4, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 1, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "C", "rightRate": 0, "score": 4, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 4, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "下列化合物中，既含有离子键，又含有共价键的是【】", "topicType": "单选题", "ueId": 2715267, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 12}, {"a": "NH<sub>4</sub>Cl", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【考情点拨】本题考查了电离、水解对pH的影响的知识点。<br>【应试指导】①CH<sub>3</sub>COOH为弱酸，其电离<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S50.png' />后溶液呈酸性pH&lt;7;②NaCl为强酸强碱盐，在溶液中不水解，溶液呈中性，pH=7;③NH<sub>4</sub>Cl为弱碱强酸盐，水解后溶液呈酸性，pH&lt;7;④NaHCO<sub>3</sub>为强碱弱酸的酸式盐，水解后溶液呈碱性，pH&gt;7。", "b": "NaCl", "c": "CH<sub>3</sub> COOH", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "NaHCO<sub>3</sub>", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715268, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "单选", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 1, "optNum": 4, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 1, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "D", "rightRate": 0, "score": 4, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 4, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "相同浓度的下列溶液，pH值最大的是【】", "topicType": "单选题", "ueId": 2715268, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 13}, {"a": "铜是负极，铜片上有气泡产生", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【考情点拨】本题考查了原电池的基本原理的知识点。<br>【应试指导】如图所示装置为铜、锌原电池，其中铜作正极，铜片上有气泡产生；锌作负极，电流从铜片经导线流向锌片，发生的总反应为<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S51.png' />。因此D项正确。", "b": "该装置可以将电能转化成化学能", "c": "电流从锌片经导线流向铜片", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "发生的总反应为<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S37.png' />", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715269, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "单选", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 1, "optNum": 4, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 1, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "D", "rightRate": 0, "score": 4, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 4, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "下列关于下图所示装置的叙述，正确的是【】<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S36.png' />", "topicType": "单选题", "ueId": 2715269, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 14}, {"a": "AgI可用于人工降雨", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【考情点拨】本题考查了物质的用途的知识点。<br>【应试指导】BaSO<sub>4</sub>可用作“钡餐”，是因为既不溶于水又不溶于酸。但BaCO<sub>3</sub>虽不溶于水，但能溶于酸。其反应的离子方程式为：<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S52.png' />。", "b": "AgBr常用于制感光材料", "c": "Na<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub>常用作呼吸面具和潜水艇里的供氧剂", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "BaCO<sub>3</sub>可代替BaSO<sub>4</sub>用作“钡餐”", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715270, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "单选", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId