"jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "一束橙色光与界面成30°角由空气射入某介质，折射角为30°，则此介质对橙色光的折射率为______，橙色光在此介质中的传播速度为______M/s。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715272, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 17}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】2750；75<br>【考情点拨】本题考查了变压器电压与匝数的关系的知识点。<br>【应试指导】n<sub>1</sub>：n<sub>2</sub>:n<sub>3</sub>=U<sub>1</sub>:U<sub>2</sub>:U<sub>3</sub>,即n<sub>1</sub>:n<sub>2</sub>:5=220:6.0:0.40,可得n<sub>1</sub>=2750,n<sub>2</sub>=75。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715273, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "为了测定变压器的原、副线圈的匝数，可以在变压器的闭合铁芯上再临时绕一个线圈，已知临时绕的线圈是5匝，将变压器的原线圈接到电压是220V的交流电源上，测得副线圈和临时绕的线圈两端的电压分别是6.0V和0.40V。由此可知这个变压器的原线圈的匝数是______匝；副线圈的匝数是______匝。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715273, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 18}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】竖直向上；0.12<br>【考情点拨】本题考查了受力平衡及左手定则的知识点。<br>【应试指导】由二力平衡可得F=f=μmg=6N,方向向右。由左手定则可判断磁场方向竖直向上，<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S56.png' />", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715274, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "如图所示，质量为1kg的金属杆静止于相距1m的两水平轨道上，金属杆中通有方向如右图所示的、大小为50A的恒定电流，两轨道间存在竖直方向的匀强磁场。金属与轨道间的动摩擦因数为0.6，欲使杆向右匀速运动，两轨道间磁场方向应为______,磁感应强度B的大小应为______T。(g=10m/s<sup>2</sup>)<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S39.png' />", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715274, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 19}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】3-甲基-4-乙基己烷<br>【考情点拨】本题考查了烷烃的系统命名的知识点。<br>【应试指导】根据有机物的命名方法：先找主链（碳原子数最多的链）可知该有机物的主链中含有6个碳原子；根据编号原则确定取代基的位置，先从取代基小的一端开始，<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S57.png' />因此本题所示结构的名称为3-甲基-4-乙基己烷。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715275, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "按系统命名法，有机物<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S40.png' />的名称为______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715275, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 20}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】0.2mol/L<br>【考情点拨】本题考查了物质的量浓度的计算的知识点。<br>【应试指导】Na2SO4溶液的物质的量为<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S58.png' />,所以Na<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>溶液的物质的量浓度为<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S59.png' />0.2mol/L。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715276, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "500mLNa<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>溶液中含有0.2mol的Na<sup>+</sup>,则Na<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>溶液的物质的量浓度为______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715276, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 21}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】HCl和NH<sub>3</sub><br>【考情点拨】本题考查了气体的水溶性的知识点。<br>【应试指导】氯化氢气体和氨气，在常温下都极易溶解于水(0℃时，1体积水约能溶解500体积的氯化氢；通常状况下，1体积水约能溶解700体积的氨气)。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715277, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "有下列几种气体：H<sub>2</sub>、O<sub>2</sub>、HCl、NO、NH<sub>3</sub>、CH<sub>4</sub>,其中通常情况下能用来和水做“喷泉”实验的是______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715277, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 22}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S60.png' /><br>【考情点拨】本题考查了水解反应的知识点。<br>【应试指导】酯的水解反应是酯化反应的逆反应。<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S61.png' />", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715278, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "在酸或碱存在的条件下，甲酸甲酯跟水发生水解反应的化学方程式为______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715278, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 23}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S62.png' /><br>【考情点拨】本题考查了弱电解质的电离的知识点。<br>【应试指导】因为氨水在常温下存在以下电离平衡：<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S63.png' />", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715279, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "常温下，氨水中存在的离子有______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715279, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 24}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S64.png' /><br>【考情点拨】本题考查了离子反应方程式的知识点。<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S65.png' />", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715280, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "碳酸氢钠溶液和烧碱溶液反应的离子方程式为______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715280, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 25}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】浓HNO<sub>3</sub>不稳定，见光受热易分解强氧化性和酸性<br>【考情点拨】本题考查了药品的存放与化学性质的知识点。<br>【应试指导】<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S66.png' />(硝酸浓度越大，越易分解)。硝酸是一种强酸，除具有酸的通性外，还具强氧化性，Cu与HNO<sub>3</sub>反应中的产物中Cu(NO<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>反映硝酸的酸性，NO反映硝酸的强氧化性。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715281, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "浓硝酸常盛装在棕色瓶中，且贮放在冷暗处，原因是______。在反应<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S41.png' />，HNO<sub>3</sub>所表现的性质是______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715281, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 26}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】溴水；NaOH溶液（或CuSO<sub>4</sub>溶液）<br>【考情点拨】本题考查了气体的净化的知识点。<br>【应试指导】由于乙烯能与Br<sub>2</sub>发生加成反应，而乙烷不能，故可以通过盛有溴水的洗气瓶，将乙烷中的乙烯除去。由于NaOH溶液能与H<sub>2</sub>S气体反应：2NaOH+H<sub>2</sub>S=Na<sub>2</sub>S+2H<sub>2</sub>O(或CuSO<sub>4</sub>+H<sub>2</sub>S=CuS↓+H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>),故能将乙炔中混有的H<sub>2</sub>S除去。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715282, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "欲除去乙烷中的乙烯，可将混合气体通过盛有______的洗气瓶；欲除去乙炔中的硫化氢，可将混合气体通过盛有______的洗气瓶。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715282, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 27}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】FeSO<sub>4</sub>·7H<sub>2</sub>0<br>【考情点拨】本题考查了结晶水合物的知识点。<br>【应试指导】由题目所给的溶液颜色的变化可知某晶体盐中的阳离子是Fe<sup>2+</sup>;当加入BaCl<sub>2</sub>溶液，产生不溶于稀HNO<sub>3</sub>的白色沉淀，可知该晶体盐中的阴离子是<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S67.png' />,从而得出该晶体盐的化学式。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715283, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "某晶体盐的水溶液呈浅绿色，在此溶液中通入氯气，溶液变为棕黄色，把所得棕黄色溶液分成两份：一份加入KSCN溶液，溶液变深红色；另一份加入BaCl<sub>2</sub>溶液，产生不溶于稀HNO<sub>3</sub>的白色沉淀，则该晶体盐的化学式是______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715283, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 28}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "物块上滑至高处平台的过程，设其到平台处的速度为1，由机械能守恒定律可得<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S68.png' />", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715284, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 11, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 11, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "(11分)一小物块以速度v0=10/s沿光滑地面滑行，然后沿光滑曲面上升到顶部水平的高台上，并由高台上飞出，如图所示。问当高台的高度五多大时，小物块飞行的水平距离最大？这个距离是多少？(g=10m/s<sup>2</sup>)<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S42.png' />", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715284, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 29}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S69.png' />", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715285, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 12, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 12, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "(12分)固定在匀强磁场中的正方形导线框abcd,各边长为l,其中ab是一段电阻为R的均匀电阻丝，其余3边均为电阻可忽略的铜线。磁场的磁感应强度为B,方向垂直纸面向里。现有一与ab段的材料、粗细、长度都相同的电阻丝PQ架在导体框上，如图所示。PQ以恒定速度v从ad滑向bc,当滑过<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S43.png' />的距离时，通过PQ段电阻丝的电流强度是多大？方向如何？<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S44.png' />", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715285, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 30}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "根据反应的化学方程式和题给条件知反应消耗BaCl<sub>2</sub>的物质的量和MgSO<sub>4</sub>相等，可得：<br>MgSO<sub>4</sub>→BaSO<sub>4</sub>→BaCl<sub>2</sub><br>1 mol   1 mol    1 mol<br>所以MgSO<sub>4</sub>的物质的量=2mol/L×0.025L=0.05mol<br>MgSO<sub>4</sub>的质量=120g/mol×0.05mol=6g<br>MgCl<sub>2</sub>的质量=10g一6g=4g<br>故MgCl<sub>2</sub>质量为4克，MgSO<sub>4</sub>质量为6克。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715286, "exerType": "模拟题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 10, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 10, "source": "模拟题一", "starCount": 0, "title": "(10分)把10 g MgCl<sub>2</sub>和MgSO<sub>4</sub>的混合物溶于适量水中，滴加2mol/L的BaCl<sub>2</sub>溶液至沉淀完全，共消耗BaCl<sub>2</sub>溶液25mL。求混合物中MgCl<sub>2</sub>和MgSO<sub>4</sub>的质量各是多少克？", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715286, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 31}], "SimExamStore": {"ExerNum": 31, "CourseId": "H011701", "ExamTime": 150, "ExerSortType": 1, "ScoringMethod": 1, "TotalScore": 150, "SimType": "模拟题", "ExamName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题一"}, "simId": 21625}